<!-- Crew Tower.

     The mark: a smooth notch with a pixel cat sheltering under it, on the
     brand's periwinkle tile. Kept identical to the emblem in
     docs/design/logo-final.html, which is itself mark 39 from the fifth round
     of exploration, unchanged. Any edit here has to be made there too, or the
     favicon and the Dock icon start telling different stories.

     The 22.5% corner radius is Apple's, so the same file is correct as a
     browser tab icon and as the source for the macOS app icon. -->
